  <name>Nelson</name>
  <summary>Extensible numerical computing environment</summary>
  <summary
    xml:lang="fr"
  >Environnement de calcul numerique extensible</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.nelson_lang.Nelson">
    <name>Allan CORNET and others</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Nelson is a matrix and array programming language for engineering and scientific computing.
      It provides an interpreter, a high-level language, plotting tools, and data structures such as cells, structs, and linear systems.
      The module system lets users add data types and operations through overloads.
      Its numerical-computing syntax helps port existing programs.</p>
    <p xml:lang="fr">Nelson est un langage de programmation matricielle et tableau pour le calcul scientifique et l&apos;ingenierie.
      Il fournit un interprete, un langage de haut niveau, des outils graphiques et des structures de donnees telles que cell, struct et systemes lineaires.
      Le systeme de modules permet d&apos;ajouter des types de donnees et des operations au moyen de surcharges.
      Sa syntaxe de calcul numerique facilite le portage de programmes existants.</p>
  </description>
